{"hw":"περιμένω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">περιμένω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">περιμένω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">wait for, await</b>, c. acc. pers., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.89</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">643</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">π. Τισσαφέρνην ἡμέρας πλείους ἢ εἴκοσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.4.1</span> </span>, etc.: c. acc. rei, <span class=\"gk\">π. ἐξ ἀγορᾶς ἰχθύδια</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">387.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ καιροῦ μὴ περιμένοντός τι</span> as the time could not <b class=\"lex-tr\">wait for</b>.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Caes.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">require, expect</b>, <span class=\"gk\">σχολάζουσαν φιληκοΐαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.172e</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">endure, put up with</b>, <span class=\"gk\">μακρὰ λέγοντας ἡμᾶς αὐτοὺς περιεμείναμεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">890e</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex